#tr.en: and it tasted excellent! 
2. ki-ma t,a3-bu lu-u2 i-de-e 
#tr.en: How good they were had I but known, 
3. mi-im-ma-ma-an a-na {d}utu-la-ma-sa3-szu 
#tr.en: a single one to Šamaš-lamassašu 
4. u2-ul u2-sze-bi-il 
#tr.en: I’d not have sent! 
5. a-nu-um-ma t,up-pi2 usz-ta-bi-la-ku 
#tr.en: Now, my tablet I've sent to you: 
6. i-nu-ma a-na tu-ur-{d}u3-gul-la2{ki} 
#tr.en: when to Tur-Ugalla 
7. tu-ra-du a-na _nu-{gesz}kiri6_ sza a-sza-ri-isz 
#tr.en: you go down, to the orchardist who right there 
8. wa-asz-bu qi2-bi2-ma 
#tr.en: lives speak! 
9. 1(u) 5(disz) u2-szu-um-mi i-na qa2-qa2-ri 
#tr.en: 15 bandicoots from the ground 
10. li-sze-lu-nim-ma szu-bi-lam 
#tr.en: he should dig up for me and send them here. 
11. u3 _udu-nita2_ a-na e-DI-li#-[x] 
#tr.en: Further: a ram for ...  
